      "few_shot_current_interpretation": "After the 2026-04-23 Step 9 rerun, few-shot LR/residual scorers repair the collapsed Step-7 LightGBM fusion baseline. The clean discovery set is E5-LR/L2 50pct, BGE-M3 residual 100pct, and LaBSE-LR/L2 100pct. However, the strongest clean E5 few-shot scorer only modestly exceeds the raw E5 semantic baseline, so Step 11 is for candidate-cluster triage and evidence audit rather than a direct proof that every cluster is same-controller.",
      "clean_scientific_candidates": [
        "core_few_shot_multilingual_e5_large_lr_l2_ratio_50pct",
        "core_few_shot_bge_m3_residual_lr_ratio_100pct",
        "core_few_shot_labse_lr_l2_ratio_100pct"
